text:
This code, from the bug submission?<p><pre><code>  impl&lt;T: &#x27;static + Send&gt; Drop for Q&lt;T&gt; {
      fn drop(&amp;mut self) { if let Some(t) = self.0.take() { KEPT.lock().unwrap().push(Box::new(t)); } }
  }
</code></pre>
The bound on T in the Drop impl means Drop is not implemented for all T, only where T: &#x27;static + Send. Q&lt;T&gt; also having the same bound doesn&#x27;t make a difference to the Drop impl.
